### Dataset Attribution
The training dataset includes URL patterns derived from academic research:
- Mohammad, R., Thabtah, F., & McCluskey, L. (2012). "Phishing Websites Dataset." UCI Machine Learning Repository.

## Educational Use Disclaimer

This software is designed for educational and research purposes in the field of
AI/ML applications to cybersecurity. While functional, it should not be used
as the sole security solution in production environments without additional
security measures and professional assessment.

The machine learning models provide estimated assessments based on URL
structural features and cannot guarantee the safety or malicious nature of
any website. Always verify suspicious URLs through multiple security sources
and professional security tools.